[{"title":"谒清烈庙登独醒亭","author":"王十朋","text":"我醉亦如众，亭惭登独醒。\n惟知慕清节，首为绘仪形。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18508,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄牛峡","author":"王十朋","text":"白狗黄牛竹节滩，奇奇怪怪几峰峦。\n山川好处造化惜，不许人间平地看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18509,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄牛庙","author":"王十朋","text":"我从白帝城，舟次黄牛峡。\n黄牛遗庙存，石马只耳缺。\n宛如欧公梦，地灵亦奇绝。\n固宜镇大川，千载食常血。\n何人赞巨力，曾不纪功烈。\n神乎岂求食，挽石骇舟楫。\n或云土胜水，兹亦强牵合。\n白帝将何云，吾为究其咒。\n神禹昔治水，疏凿九州别。\n百神各效职，僚佐力俱竭。\n功成禹化熊，涂山亦为石。\n譬如穆南征，化者想非一。\n有化为牛者，断崖留遗迹。\n岂亦黄帝馀，与牛同一色。\n至今名此峡，援溺有阴力。\n淫祠自其俗，神手本正直。\n爵以保安侯，足以章神德。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18510,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虾蟆碚水","author":"王十朋","text":"虾蟆好居水，背水以自濡。\n不知背上味，乃与众水殊。\n品第高水经，煎茶必来须。\n争汲以致远，不惮险且迂。\n我亦走瓶罂，一瓯瀹云腴。\n所恨太遐僻，亲朋莫能呼。\n巨蛙如有灵，曷不上天衢。\n以水为雨露，助天泽寰区。\n坎视峡中小，笑渠子阳愚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18511,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石渔翁","author":"王十朋","text":"钓利钓名者，纷纷三峡中。\n何人化为石，又作钓鱼翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18512,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至喜亭","author":"王十朋","text":"前年泊舟至喜亭，舍舟触雾登山行。\n身到猿啼虎啸处，至今魂梦中宵惊。\n两年寒暑深山里，瘴疠侵凌身不死。\n七月归舟浮涨江，重见兹亭实堪喜。\n世间忧喜无定形，此喜本从忧得名。\n须知既济有未济，勿谓江流今已平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18513,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又一绝","author":"王十朋","text":"归客来登至喜亭，喜归兼喜峡江平。\n当时作记文章伯，不止文章得美名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18514,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郭道山","author":"王十朋","text":"学道无成艺有成，青山犹以道为名。\n匆匆不及登山看，归看家山白鹿城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18515,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿灌口","author":"王十朋","text":"拂晓出楚塞，中流望荆门。\n江随铜柱转，舟遇虎牙奔。\n鸟度南天阔，鱼翻秋水浑。\n宜都转盼过，夜宿旧江村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18516,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江陵舟中作","author":"王十朋","text":"梦里身曾到永安，孤城绝塞俯惊湍。\n东归初喜楚天阔，西望堪嗟蜀道难。\n滟滪堆边已陈迹，水晶宫里又粗官。\n帝乡咫尺家乡近，臣子忧心亦小宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18517,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"查元章自成都走书至江陵并贶蜀笺附子","author":"王十朋","text":"芝兰道山旧，邂逅夔江边。\n会合止半载，别离又经年。\n君犹滞使轺，我忽移霅川。\n东归不及见，西望心悠然。\n尺书走健卒，追上江陵船。\n慇勤赠远意，药百纸以千。\n我老苦多病，得药年可延。\n静思苦口味，奚止沉疴痊。\n但非造楼手，误辱文房笺。\n待将君诗文，传写千万篇。\n书言作二记，付与夔人镌。\n捍波记修垒，济渴记义泉。\n深惭郡政谬，滥托雄文传。\n君才高辈流，君誉蔼民编。\n雅志在活人，何心肯流钱。\n当宁正念贾，诸公咸荐贤。\n定归玉笋班，慷慨旒扆前。\n所陈必尧舜，那肯谈武宣。\n早趣舍人装，行著祖生鞭。\n我冠傥未挂，苕溪迟言旋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18518,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离沙市天色变舟人惧风作少憩公安而行默祷有应","author":"王十朋","text":"解任古夔国，移官白蘋洲。\n三峡虽幸免，大江尚堪忧。\n黎明雾四塞，篙师请停舟。\n尔祷于公安，吾祷学孔丘。\n恺悌以为治，洁廉以自修。\n神乎苟听之，庶不为神羞。\n须臾日光漏，江净烟霭收。\n愿如吾祖言，千里俱安流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18519,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望石首山 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"江山遥望疑若无，隐隐渐露山规摹。\n化工作山首安石，不著草木为肌肤。\n吾乡石首黄金色，五年不见深思忆。\n山头有石名偶同，长铗空弹不堪食。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18520,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望石首山 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"巴夔之山厌太多，荆江其奈无山何。\n舟中遥遥望石首，一点亦足供吟哦。\n舣舟亦向刘郎洑，应是刘郎招我宿。\n刘郎如问旧江山，永安宫草年年绿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18521,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过三沱","author":"王十朋","text":"舟从三峡过三沱，柳岸人家转盼过。\n莫惜慇勤问舟子，江边好处亦无多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18522,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"塔子山","author":"王十朋","text":"已过鲁家洑，犹瞻石首山。\n水随江缭绕，山逐岸回环。\n雨泊芦洲畔，舟行晚照间。\n贪看洞庭好，不作沌中还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18523,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鲁家洑","author":"王十朋","text":"江头烟树色如故，记得向来舟出时。\n更读西行旧诗集，集中多是沌中诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18524,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿人老湾","author":"王十朋","text":"衮衮长江水，悠悠归去船。\n片云南岸雨，明月别州天。\n犬为客惊盗，蚊令人废眠。\n江湾号人老，惊我鬓皤然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18525,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乌沙镇避风","author":"王十朋","text":"风避乌沙镇，心怀白帝城。\n峡中险已过，江上浪宜平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18526,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"维舟岳阳之西岸徐师汊风作不敢行再留一宿用韩昌黎洞庭阻风韵示同行朱仲文张子是","author":"王十朋","text":"月行南箕口，簸扬不肯休。\n我至洞庭侧，狂澜阻行舟。\n东望岳阳城，一苇宿可投。\n吾欲破巨浪，试呼舟子谋。\n舟子笑谓我，官岂乘浮丘。\n同行一二官，好勇岂仲由。\n君子不行险，少迟勿烦啾。\n明朝风自定，鼓枻无忧愁。\n汗颜答舟子，汝语非谬悠。\n书以示同人，欲速不可求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18527,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望洞庭","author":"王十朋","text":"端居滟滪两经年，不戒瞿唐七月船。\n得得遥从洞庭过，要看湖涨水中天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18528,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贾岳州以予阻风致酒肉之赠","author":"王十朋","text":"轩皇张乐洞庭旁，掀舞鱼龙撼岳阳。\n卮酒豚肩使君意，知予肉味未能忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18529,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鱼虾","author":"王十朋","text":"买得巴陵金鲫鱼，又逢公子奋长须。\n夜来江山秋风起，报道吴儿已鲙鲈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18530,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初欲维舟岳阳楼下适风作遂泊南津","author":"王十朋","text":"岳阳楼下风波恶，过客舟行不容泊。\n遥从湖口入南津，看尽湖山与城郭。\n楼阁峥嵘照眼明，君山当面如蓬瀛。\n雄文谁继范文正，妙曲亦无滕子京。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18531,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞庭湖 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"江山好处未经眼，人道岳阳天下无。\n入笔波澜自今阔，匈中已有洞庭湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18532,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞庭湖 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"维舟便上岳阳楼，风定波澜万顷秋。\n闻说洞庭通震泽，水应先我到蘋洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18533,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读岳阳楼记","author":"王十朋","text":"先忧后乐范文正，此志此言高孟轲。\n暇日登临固宜乐，其如天下有忧何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18534,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君山 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"恃险三苗此为国，不知诸夏有华勋。\n两阶干羽七旬后，从此湖山方有君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18535,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君山 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"祖龙迁怒色曾赪，帝子有灵山更青。\n湖水如天冬亦涸，此君荣落一般形。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18536,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南津淑济庙","author":"王十朋","text":"越国曹娥孝可书，惜无同气与之俱。\n武陵今有贤儿女，弟似灵均娣女须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18537,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过仙亭","author":"王十朋","text":"此处神仙几度经，老松枯朽稚松青。\n如今想作天仙去，不复飞吟过洞庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18538,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"解舟遇风暂泊岳阳城下正对君山","author":"王十朋","text":"入湖初讶君山远，无翼可随鸥鹭群。\n系缆中流忽相对，江湖心亦不忘君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18539,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳城下岸赤色亦呼赤壁","author":"王十朋","text":"岳阳楼下有赤壁，照耀洞庭烟水东。\n鄂渚巴陵土多赭，周郎何处破曹公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18540,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君山形如龙南有一小山如龟","author":"王十朋","text":"洞庭湖山山绝奇，大山如龙小如龟。\n弄珠曳尾自游戏，不肯吹浪如蛟螭。\n岳阳楼前铁为械，古人欲断蛟螭害。\n蛟螭为害甚巴蛇，遗冢犹存足为戒。\n七百里湖涵太虚，春夏涨溢秋冬枯。\n惟有龟龙长自在，不知几见桑田改。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18541,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"燕公楼","author":"王十朋","text":"燕公郡事暇，诗兴满沧波。\n粉饰开元治，江山为助多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18542,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道人矶 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"江中双石如弟兄，呼得道人为友生。\n秋夜扁舟泊矶下，洞庭湖近月华明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18543,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道人矶 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"道人身名两俱槁，道其所道非吾道。\n横江两石作钓矶，不似严陵台上好。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18544,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊潜江甲","author":"王十朋","text":"潜江甲口楚天涯，芦荻舟中一两家。\n呼酒敕厨无一味，天鹅乱眼似杨花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18545,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟遇逆风破浪赋诗","author":"王十朋","text":"风撼楚江水，云横鄂渚天。\n支颐看山色，破浪出诗篇。\n门掩濒江舍，帆扬上水船。\n江神不借便，归兴自飘然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18546,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中览镜","author":"王十朋","text":"来往成何事，霜毛满鬓多。\n洋洋大江水，东去欲如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18547,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过嘉鱼县","author":"王十朋","text":"舟过嘉鱼县，买鱼人道无。\n青山不堪煮，弹铗看铜符。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18548,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿通济口","author":"王十朋","text":"沌水从兹入，中藏寂寞乡。\n相逢如故旧，为我济归航。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18549,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百人矶","author":"王十朋","text":"归从三峡水，重见百人矶。\n山色只如旧，挽舟人已非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18550,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南浦","author":"王十朋","text":"江淹送客伤心处，万里人从蜀道来。\n柳已三番见秋色，萧萧双鬓若何哉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18551,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南楼","author":"王十朋","text":"江汉西来于此会，朝宗东去不须分。\n银涛遥带岷峨雪，烟渚高连巫峡云。\n鹦鹉洲悲狂处士，蛟龙池化故将军。\n登临长愿如今日，尘静元规楚不氛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18552,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"解舟风犹未息暂止江口","author":"王十朋","text":"狂飙未息浪峥嵘，江口停舟不敢行。\n自是吾侪畏行险，前头波浪有舟横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18553,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊舟汉口","author":"王十朋","text":"稍稍风波定，悠悠舟楫移。\n身虽到汉口，家尚在天涯。\n大别思大禹，古峰怀古夔。\n山城有廖廓，归说是吾儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18554,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄鹤楼","author":"王十朋","text":"云锁吕公洞，月明黄鹤楼。\n抱关非故卒，谁见羽衣游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18555,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七矶","author":"王十朋","text":"江上风波恶，江中洲渚多。\n回头三峡远，转盼七矶过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18556,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄州","author":"王十朋","text":"弭棹大江滨，江山入眼新。\n地疑真赤壁，州是古黄人。\n水隔三分国，风遗两逐臣。\n雪堂欣觌面，诗思定能神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18557,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东坡十一绝 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"道大才高世不容，堪嗟尺水困神龙。\n空游赤壁英姿发，却向小桥诗思浓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18558,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东坡十一绝 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"出处平生慕乐天，东坡名自乐天传。\n文章均得江山助，但觉前贤畏后贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18559,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东坡十一绝 其三","author":"王十朋","text":"少年下笔已如神，文到黄州更绝尘。\n我宋人才盛元祐，玉堂人是雪堂人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18560,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东坡十一绝 其四","author":"王十朋","text":"世重元之重竹楼，雪堂名更重黄州。\n西山草木尤光彩，一一曾经杖屦游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18561,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东坡十一绝 其五","author":"王十朋","text":"江绕山城柳暗村，五年诗乱谪仙魂。\n欲寻遗老问前事，楚语儿童今不存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18562,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东坡十一绝 其六","author":"王十朋","text":"再闰黄州正坐诗，诗因迁谪更瑰奇。\n读公赤壁词并赋，如见周郎破贼时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18563,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东坡十一绝 其七","author":"王十朋","text":"供成诗案脱累囚，天遣公来此地游。\n自有胸中云梦泽，更居云梦泽南州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18564,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东坡十一绝 其八","author":"王十朋","text":"三道策成名烜赫，万言书就迹危疑。\n易书论语忘忧患，天下三经字说时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18565,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东坡十一绝 其九","author":"王十朋","text":"口诵渊明归去词，岷峨归去竟无欺。\n高安难弟来相访，细说对床风雨时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18566,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东坡十一绝 其十","author":"王十朋","text":"批风抹月五经年，吟尽淮南尽处天。\n独与元之韩魏国，神交千古作三贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18567,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东坡十一绝 其十一","author":"王十朋","text":"向来茅屋仅容身，今日祠堂高更新。\n费尽丹青传不得，灵台一点与精神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18568,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至九江陪林守黄中登庾楼出示旧诗","author":"王十朋","text":"万里相望牛马风，兹楼邂逅一尊同。\n烟生燕寝香炉上，鼋在宾筵食指中。\n舟入沧波咏蘋白，饮陪文字胜裙红。\n飞黄腾踏日边去，回首群惊冀北空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18569,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喻叔奇自鄱阳来以诗见赠次韵以酬","author":"王十朋","text":"家居雁宕芙蓉侧，身自瞿塘滟滪回。\n览尽江山归路远，舞翻乌鹊故人来。\n诗吟夔子相思句，酒饮鄱阳未尽杯。\n种学绩文宜馆阁，二松那复久淹徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18570,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琵琶亭","author":"王十朋","text":"系舟琵琶秋水深，夜静不闻琵琶音。\n往来多少商妇怨，世无司马谁沾襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18571,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过彭泽","author":"王十朋","text":"万里归舟巨浪间，只将青眼对青山。\n青山好处惟彭泽，出岫云归倦鸟还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18572,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马当山","author":"王十朋","text":"此地水如峡，有山名马当。\n犹疑是滟滪，更合戒舟航。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18573,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"那刹石","author":"王十朋","text":"七月下三巴，孤舟近九华。\n魂犹惊滟滪，石更见那查。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18574,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池之清溪如杭之西湖某归自三峡维舟弄水亭南望齐山翠微在眼登谯楼望九华见一峰奇甚呈提举李子长知郡赵富文","author":"王十朋","text":"城南风物似西湖，万里归舟入画图。\n光洁贮怀便弄水，翠微照眼称提壶。\n浦无时节秋尤好，池有精神贵可呼。\n最是九华知客意，倚天遥露一峰孤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18575,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子长和诗复酬二首 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"往岁遥从彭蠡湖，常山地阅武侯图。\n忽乘雪里子猷棹，欣对花间太白壶。\n雁宕寄书知有便，天台采药定相呼。\n两翁异日为邻舍，笑说江山大小孤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18576,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子长和诗复酬二首 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"君往东湖我左湖，田园归去亦良图。\n纵如傅说妙调鼎，终羡渊明高引壶。\n清峭台中各陈迹，翠微亭上偶欢呼。\n江东浙右从今后，永夜月同千里孤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":18577,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]